<title>USA: National City completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>National City completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>National City Bancshares Inc said Tuesday it has completed the acquisition of the First National Bank of Wayne City, Illinois, from Marine Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the acqusition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>First National had assets of $52 million as of December.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
